ss=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-WTQ0dwsgtot3Mux4ZXOl05hSgTH\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-AmqcddMWAotWQFxJT6xl8CElghf\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RKcrd7u17ogCsex6cUPlJ2cCgkh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, với dạng đề map, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ tập trung n&oacute;i về c&aacute;c sự thay đổi ch&iacute;nh:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Swt2dWnJPov1iFx7DZLlCGgugmf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>từ một thư viện truyền thống th&agrave;nh một cơ sở hiện đại với nhiều tiện &iacute;ch mới</div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-G8wFdi5iToyI2PxhLp1lMkNOgec\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>loại bỏ khu vực đa phương tiện v&agrave; khu đọc s&aacute;ch, th&ecirc;m c&aacute;c khu vực mới như ph&ograve;ng giảng, ph&ograve;ng m&aacute;y t&iacute;nh v&agrave; qu&aacute;n caf&eacute;</div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-JLrudDKQVoB78vxXmgzldmNBgLh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-M2Q9ds2Mgoz0ICx8JzslKUMJgWf\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<h3 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VqlMdCrpLo9ZDwxoVI4lrX3Qgcg\"><span style=\"color: rgb(240, 95, 35);\"><strong>4.</strong><strong> Ph&acirc;n chia BODY r&otilde; r&agrave;ng</strong></span></h3>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-RIbUdfSlNoloclxlVrOltQUhg8e\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P98ZdcS4KoF2cIxRdnYl02e4gre\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-FVyzdmf9noY8HEx1DxAl475ZgPh\">\n<div data-page-id=\"N0Dfd70vKo3C16x22MllfNEwg8e\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-ZRV0dgAnjoXiRVxRxmol5UwwgBb\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ chia đoạn th&acirc;n b&agrave;i một c&aacute;ch r&otilde; r&agrave;ng, bằng c&aacute;ch gom c&aacute;c sự thay đổi dựa tr&ecirc;n ti&ecirc;u ch&iacute; <strong>về mặt địa l&yacute;</strong>:</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 1:</strong><strong> &nbsp;</strong><strong>Khu vực ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n&nbsp;</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-CpWhdSGJFoye2PxbbFelCRADg5e\">Theo <strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 1 như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-TjXGdfvftoNtdnxAPJtlOrI6gQb\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) Vị tr&iacute; dọc tường ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n - 20 năm trước: c&oacute; ph&ograve;ng <em><strong>CDs, videos and computer games</strong></em><em> b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i, b&ecirc;n phải c&oacute; ph&ograve;ng </em><em><strong>children's books</strong></em><em> đối diện với khu </em><em><strong>adult non-fiction books </strong></em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-Ms7cdGYXkom5eXxBAZNlh2dCg8c\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) Vị tr&iacute; dọc tường ph&iacute;a tr&ecirc;n<strong> </strong>- b&acirc;y giờ: <em>thay đổi</em> <em>đ&aacute;ng kể, </em><em><strong>multimedia section</strong></em><em> đổi th&agrave;nh </em><em><strong>storytelling area</strong></em><em> c&oacute; </em><em><strong>sofas</strong></em><em>, khu vực </em><em><strong>children's book section</strong></em><em> được thay thế bằng </em><em><strong>lecture room</strong></em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-VXEqdwEFDo1cLRxlGkgl47uFg2b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) Khu vực giữa ph&ograve;ng: <em><strong>adult fiction books</strong></em><em> v&agrave; </em><em><strong>information desk</strong></em><em> thế chỗ của </em><em><strong>adult non-fiction books</strong></em><em> b&ecirc;n phải </em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-P28wdkqCxoxJzCxhGfIlLa1cgwd\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-PlnOdHjiuoEse4xeDDrlsghVgug\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<h4 class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(51, 164, 51);\"><strong>BODY 2</strong><strong>: Khu vực ph&iacute;a dưới</strong></span></h4>\n<div class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-EwzTddSWRoqDSGxM4hFlvPg1grc\" style=\"text-align: justify;\">Theo&nbsp;<strong>Logical Framework<sup>&copy;</sup></strong>, ch&uacute;ng m&igrave;nh sẽ định hướng c&aacute;c bạn viết từng bước ở BODY 2 như sau:\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<div style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-page-id=\"YP3XdinBZozo9Qx3V4elcqv1gBd\" data-lark-html-role=\"root\" data-docx-has-block-data=\"false\">\n<ul class=\"list-bullet1\">\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-XgtrdIQdooJX80xnsdxljg2Oglh\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 1) Vị tr&iacute; dọc tường ph&iacute;a dưới - 20 năm trước: <em>c&oacute; </em><em><strong>reading room</strong></em><em> ở b&ecirc;n tr&aacute;i v&agrave; </em><em><strong>enquiry desk</strong></em><em> ở b&ecirc;n phải</em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-BCR6dr0lMohDuwxl5IdlHOD1g9b\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 2) Vị tr&iacute; dọc tường ph&iacute;a dưới - b&acirc;y giờ: <em>được thay thế lần lượt bằng </em><em><strong>computer room</strong></em><em> v&agrave; qu&aacute;n </em><em><strong>caf&eacute;</strong></em></div>\n</li>\n<li class=\"ace-line ace-line old-record-id-N3UVdKgEtoiss3xAdiil0pQQgyf\" data-list=\"bullet\">\n<div>(Step 3) Những tiện &iacute;ch mới: <em><strong>self-serving machines</strong></em><em>, </em><em><strong>information desk</strong></em><em> v&agrave; khu vực d&agrave;nh ri&ecirc;ng cho </em><em><strong>reference books</strong></em></div>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>",
        "writing_logical_frame": [
          {
            "id": 788,
            "sort": 1,
